                "organization": "Foodvest Holding WLL",
                "biography": "Mateo Ramos is a highly influential figure in the food and beverage (F&B) industry, known for his extensive experience managing and advising over 1,000 restaurants across the United States, GCC, and North Africa.\n\nHis expertise spans finance, mergers and acquisitions (M&A), culture change, and change management in F&B companies and concepts.\n\nMateo has made significant contributions to iconic brands like Azteca Mexicana, Burger King, Buffalo Wild Wings, Texas Chicken, Vogue Cafe, Aubaine, Dylan’s Candy Bar, L’occitane Cafe, La Pâtisserie des Rêves, Alice Pizza, current Foodvest brands - Caribou Coffee, Fuddruckers, Marble Slab and Francesco’s Pizza Cafe, among others. He excels at optimizing financial strategies, orchestrating successful M&A deals, catalyzing cultural transformations, and guiding organizations through change with a dynamic and engaging speaking style.",
