                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/1255f4454d664f8d92346e01094267ab.jpeg",
                "organization": "Arab News",
                "biography": "Reina Takla is a seasoned business editor with a talent for strategic planning and crafting engaging editorial content across various mediums. She leads teams of reporters and editors and produce impactful storytelling that resonates with targeted audiences.\n\nHer expertise extends to conducting interviews with senior figures in both public and private sectors, covering a broad spectrum of topics including energy, renewables, mining, cybersecurity, AI, financial markets, defense, hospitality and aviation.\n\nPrior to her editorial career, Reina excelled in the banking sector as a relationship and wealth manager, catering to high net worth individuals and non-corporate entities. With an impressive two-decade tenure in the industry, she brings a wealth of experience and insight.\n\nReina is also a certified corporate and academic instructor, drawing upon over a decade of practical knowledge in finance and economics to deliver engaging and informative educational sessions. Her passion for sharing knowledge enriches the learning experiences of her students, making complex topics accessible and comprehensible.",
