                "organization": "Studio 49",
                "biography": "Fritz Dickamp is the Managing Director of “Studio 49”, an award-winning online marketing agency for the hospitality industry, as well as the initiator and host of the podcast & edutainment platform “SMACK Hospitality”. SMACK tells the stories of the industry’s most well-known decision-makers in engaging conversations and other various formats.\n\nFritz has specialized in digital marketing with an enthusiastic approach to e-commerce and digitization of the hospitality and tourism sector after graduating from Ecole Hôtelière de Lausanne in 2013. Besides managing one of the leading online marketing agencies in hospitality in Europe, Fritz is engaged in advisory boards, lecturing at several European hospitality management schools and acts as a keynote speaker with previous records of speaking at TedX, hospitality conventions such as ITB, IHIF, WTM, ATM and tourism fares around the world. He is a member of the “Premium Speakers” network and regularly entertains audiences with his knowledgeable and fun presentations that create plenty of food for thought.\n\nHis favorite topics are such as:\n\n• Start-Up & Entrepreneurship in Hospitality & beyond\n\n• Digital Marketing & E-Commerce – how to win the game!\n\n• Hospitality Service – what other industries can learn from the hospitality world!\n\n• It's a question of attitude – and generation!\n\n• Tell me why! A journey through generations and what they expect online\n\n\nFritz Dickamp belongs to a generation of thought leaders in the hospitality industry that combines enthusiasm for the industry with an understanding of modern business models in the digital age.",
