                "jobTitle": "Director General, Investment Development Division",
                "lastName": "M. Al-Shanqiti",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/df0dbe950d0e42cdb9471d071bc9e51f.jpeg",
                "organization": "Royal Commission for Jubail and Yanbu (RCJY).",
                "biography": "Eng. Abdulaziz M. Alshingiti is General Manager in the Royal Commission for Jubail and Yanbu (RCJY). With a career spanning over a decade, he has held various leadership roles, including Director General of the Investment Development Division since February 2022. He began his career as Mechanical Engineering Supervisor at Saudi Binladin Group and in February 2009, he transitioned to his first role in RCJY as Manager of Residential Investment Development. Eng. Alshingiti steadily climbed the ranks, serving as Manager of Industrial Investment Development, Industrial Cluster Manager, and Director of Industrial Investment Development, among others. Beyond his individual accomplishments, he has also played an integral role in various committees for national transformation programs and national industrial strategies. Collaborating with experts from diverse backgrounds, he has contributed valuable insights and helped shape important initiatives that drive the growth and development of the RCJY. Eng. Abdulaziz graduated from King Abdulaziz University in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia with a Bachelor of Engineering and Desalination Technology.",
