                "value": "<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/g6MUgYFmaE0?si=7XZ3ZOaowvK1QM_d\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch online</a></p><p>Da Pino was Riyadh’s first Italian restaurant and the stepping stone to where Riyadh’s dining scene is today.  Why is Al Khozama bringing it back now?</p><p><strong>Jennifer Pettinger Haines</strong> In conversation with <strong>Cladys Magagna,</strong> Corporate Director of Food and Beverage, Al Khozama</p>",
