                "biography": "Rana Tabbara is a seasoned multimedia journalist with a wealth of experience in economic and social news coverage. Her journalistic prowess shines through her special interviews with CEOs of major companies and prominent government figures worldwide.\n\nHaving made valuable contributions to global media outlets, Rana found her niche at CNN Business Arabic, where she extensively covers real estate news, establishing herself as an expert in the field.\n\nHer dedication to providing comprehensive reports tailored to readers' needs is evident in her work. Since joining CNN Business Arabic, Rana has infused the platform's content with her unique perspective, crafting distinctive stories and conducting successful interviews with VIPs, further solidifying her reputation as a top-notch journalist in the industry.",
