                "id": "U3BlYWtlcihFdmVudF8xNzM5ODMyLEV2ZW50UGVvcGxlXzMwMjQ0OTkxLFVzZXJfMTc0MjM3OTEp",
                "jobTitle": "Chief Operating Officer",
                "lastName": "Mundy Clowry",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/4b87482b6ba34cdd855ee4941808b88f.jpeg",
                "organization": "Beyond Bamboo",
                "biography": "Simone Mundy-Clowry is a seasoned executive with a diverse background in finance, real estate, and sustainable development. With a career spanning from the Chicago Board of Trade to the helm of one of Europe's most ambitious regeneration projects, Simone brings a wealth of experience and insight to the table.\n\n\nBeginning her career in the fast-paced environment of the Chicago Board of Trade, Simone honed her financial acumen and strategic thinking. Her tenure at Knight Dragon, where she held a pivotal role in Europe's largest regeneration project on London’s Greenwich Peninsula, further solidified her reputation as a leader capable of navigating complex challenges with finesse. \n\nSimone's educational journey is equally impressive, holding a Bachelor of Science in Property Economics, a Diploma in Investment, and a Master of Science in Real Estate Finance. This academic foundation, coupled with her hands-on experience, equips her with a multifaceted understanding of the real estate and investment landscape.\n\nCurrently serving as the COO & CFO of Beyond Bamboo Global, Simone is at the forefront of driving sustainable innovation in the hospitality sector. Beyond Bamboo Global is a trailblazing company committed to revolutionizing the hospitality industry through environmentally conscious practices and cutting-edge solutions. Under Simone's leadership, the company is spearheading initiatives that not only redefine standards but also pave the way for a more sustainable future.\n\nAs a thought leader and influencer in both finance and sustainable development, Simone is sought after for her expertise. Her insights into the intersection of real estate, finance, and sustainability make her a valuable voice in shaping the future of the hospitality industry.",
