                "organization": "SingularityNET",
                "biography": "Janet Adams is a highly sought-after speaker and thought leader in the fields of artificial intelligence (AI) and blockchain, with published works on Ethics and Regulation of AI. As the Chief Operating Officer (COO) of SingularityNET, Janet brings her extensive expertise and insights to the stage, captivating audiences with her deep understanding of disruptive technologies and their potential impact on various industries. With a passion for AI ethics and regulation, Janet's talks often revolve around the responsible and ethical use of AI in today's rapidly evolving world, alongside the positive potential of decentralised Artificial General Intelligence (AGI). She shares her experiences and knowledge gained from her leadership role at SingularityNET, where she spearheads AI and Blockchain initiatives across multiple vertical markets, including robotics, biotech, gaming and metaverse, media, DeFi, music, and arts. Her visionary leadership and dedication to a positive and beneficial Singularity for the benefit of humanity make her an influential thought leader in the AI and blockchain industries.",
