                "lastName": "Laloye",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/87c9b931df3243d1a7ea88d1c7554587.jpeg",
                "organization": "Marriott International",
                "biography": "With over a decade of extensive experience in the hospitality and real estate sectors, Julien is adept at driving mixed-use development projects to success. Currently serving as the Director of Mixed-Use Development for the EMEA region at Marriott International, he looks after the growth of Marriott brands in the branded residential sector across the EMEA region.\n\nPrior to his current role, he held pivotal positions at renowned organizations across diverse global locations. During his tenure as Vice President – Hotels Advisory for JLL in Nairobi, then Hong-Kong, he advised Attendeess and developers on their hospitality investments across sub-Saharan Africa as well as Asia Pacific. His tenure with Emaar Hospitality Group in hotel and branded residence development further enriched his understanding of development dynamics in the regional market.\n\nFueled by a passion for innovation and a commitment to excellence, Julien continues to drive forward-thinking strategies that redefine mixed-use developments, leaving a lasting impact on the landscape of hospitality and real estate.",
