                "organization": "QUO",
                "biography": "Innately curious, with a passion for cultural narratives and human behaviour, Catherine supports QUO’s multidisciplinary teams as they form distinctive brands for QUO’s diverse base of clients. \n�Catherine initially joined QUO as content director, before moving into brand strategy, building and establishing brand cultural definition as a core component of QUO’s offering. \n\nShe has worked with many of QUO’s key clients, conceptualizing and re-imagining brands from small independent hotels to global hospitality groups, across numerous cultures and destinations within Asia Pacific,�the Middle East and Europe.\n\nA graduate of University College London (UCL), Catherine previously worked as a journalist, writer and editor for a variety of lifestyle and business publications.",
