                "organization": "Cirque du Soleil Entertainment Group",
                "biography": "Martin Boudreau is a seasoned executive producer of location-based entertainment. For 20 years, Martin put his engineering and business expertise to the service of Cirque du Soleil, developing international partnerships and spearheading a broad range of entertainment projects across the hospitality, nightlife and theme park industries. Among these, the Joya dinner-show in Riviera Maya (Mexico) is routinely cited as an example of entertainment and hospitality pioneers successfully coming together in delivering an exceptional guest experience.\n\nIn recent years, Martin joined forces with Balich Wonder Studio, where he supported the development of their destination experiences, most notably by materializing an agreement with Disney Concerts to create \"Disney: The Castle”, which premiered in Riyadh in November 2023.\n\nMartin is now President and CEO of 44Productions, a boutique firm he founded to help bring groundbreaking projects to life, with new and long-standing partners alike.",
