                "organization": "Tourism Development Fund",
                "biography": "17 years of experience in Project Management, Planning, Development and Strategy. Ambitious and driven to contribute to the country’s ambitions in achieving vision 2030. The Tourism sector is one of the main pillars of vision 2030, and the Tourism Development Fund aims to unlock the sector and fulfill Saudi vision 2030.\n\nExperiences:\n\n15 Years of experience working for Saudi Aramco as a Work Director for several Departments, from 2005 until 2020. Then moved to Tourism Development Fund as Head of Partnerships then transitioned to Lead Strategy which is my current position (Executive Director of Strategy).\n\n\nEducation:\n\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology:\nMaster of Business Administration (MBA) 2013 - 2015\nColumbia University in the City of New York:\nMaster of Science, Electrical Engineering 2009 – 2011\n\nVanderbilt University:\nBachelor of Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mathematics (Dual Degree) 2001 -2004",
