                "biography": "Ian is a senior hospitality expert; he's worked on some of Europe and the Middle East's most reputable VIP private members clubs. This includes the launch of Home House London, The Club at Cafe Royal, The Devonshire Club and Buddha Bar London as well as the relaunch and refurbishments of The Art Club London and Capital Club Dubai, DIFC. More recently, Ian was the Commercial Director for Expo 2020 overseeing 100 + hospitality concepts and Chief Hospitality Officer at Rikaz Properties in Riyadh.\n\nIan is the Executive Director of Venues MDLBEAST - he oversees the development of venues:\nBeast Houses, Music Driven Hospitality Venues, Hospitality Services and Membership.",
