                "id": "U3BlYWtlcihFdmVudF8xNzM5ODMyLEV2ZW50UGVvcGxlXzI5MDU1MTcyLFVzZXJfMTYyOTQ2MzEp",
                "jobTitle": "Tourism Projects Director",
                "lastName": "Lopez",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/c2b7dd92cad5410880c48278c22d9e07.png",
                "organization": "Baheej",
                "biography": "As Tourism Project Director, Stefano brings a wealth of experience in luxury hotel operations, guest experience, destination management, and tour operations. His expertise lies in developing innovative strategies and implementation plans for cutting-edge destinations.\n\nStefano adopts a multidisciplinary approach that encompasses various aspects such as hospitality, feasibility, hotel development, destination management, and placemaking. He possesses extensive knowledge of the hotel operators market, destination management companies, and tour operators, and knows how to effectively integrate these elements to serve the overall destination strategy.\n\nHis dedication to community development, sustainable travel, and eco-tourism is evident through his involvement in conservation initiatives and projects across the globe. Stefano is continually cultivating his expertise by staying informed about industry practices, predicting upcoming travel trends, and staying up-to-date with the latest advancements in guest experiences and hospitality management.\n\nStefano holds a Bachelor's degree in International Studies and a postgraduate certificate in Hotel Development and Feasibility from EHL. In his previous roles, he has served as the Director of the award-winning Nihi Sumba resort and as a Travel Designer for the renowned Butterfield & Robinson Travel outfitter.",
