                "biography": "As the CEO of Smeralda Holding Group and the Destination Costa Smeralda, Mario developed in\nthe most recent years the Costa Smeralda to become the leading luxury and lifestyle tourism\ndestination in the world by creating a diverse collection of ultra luxury hotels, restaurants, beach\nclubs, Spas, retail and entertainment, delivering unique experiences in all aspects, exceeding\ncustomer, employee, and Attendees expectations.\nMario created the vision of the 2.0 Costa Smeralda and spearheaded the design and product\ninnovation process of the destination, signing strategic partnerships with Cheval Blanc, Belmond,\nZuma, Matsuhisa Nobu, Nikki Beach, Beefbar, Shiseido and many other brands, creating a unique\ntourism proposition with strong authentic local roots blended with innovative and contemporary\nluxury and lifestyle concepts taking the destination to the next level.\nMario is adept at fostering strong relationships with all key stakeholders, establishing and\ncommunicating vision, objectives and expectations, driving performance to maximize results and\ncreate value.\nHe is driven by a passion to build and grow organizations and create company cultures with a\nprofound purpose.\nPrior joining Smeralda Holding and Costa Smeralda as CEO, Mario held several management\npositions with Marriott and Hilton in Europe and in the Middle East.",
