                "biography": "Her leadership focuses on facilitating opportunities for both UK businesses looking to expand globally and global destinations targeting the UK travel trade. She is also an established leader in the field of resilience and crisis management, acting as the business development director for the Global Travel and Tourism Resilience Council.\n\nWith a proven record of achievement and extensive contacts in the travel industry, Daniela brings valuable experience from both large corporate and start-up environments, consistently delivering commercial success.\n\nBefore joining Jacobs Media in 2014, Daniela delivered her expertise to respected brands such as WTTC, PATA, Octopus Travel, and eWaterways.",
