                "organization": "Hilton Worldwide Services Limited",
                "biography": "Elyza Falzon leads Hilton’s Architecture, Design & Construction team in the Middle East and Africa. The richly diverse, multi-disciplinary team skilfully supports Owners and Developers with the delivery of best-in-class hotels, resorts and residences across the region.\n\nWith twenty years of experience, Elyza is well versed in international hospitality design. Elyza moved to Dubai fifteen years ago and has since gained a broad understanding of global and regional requirements. Prior to Dubai, Elyza lived and worked in Milan, where she kicked off her career as a design consultant collaborating on a range of internationally branded hotels and resorts across Europe and the Middle East.\n\nPassionate and vocal about Women in Leadership, Elyza dedicates time to mentoring the younger generation of leaders in the business.",
