                "jobTitle": "CEO & Founder",
                "lastName": "Zhran",
                "photoUrl": "https://cdn-api.swapcard.com/public/images/c2a8cb08a8814029b1b5a58cd12a18f7.png",
                "organization": "Tenance",
                "biography": "Mohamed Zahran is a motivated high school student and dedicated entrepreneur, currently serving as the CEO & Founder of Tenace. His journey into the world of business began with a keen interest in rental property management, which he has transformed into a thriving venture through Tenace. With a focus on innovation, Mohamed has led the strategic planning efforts for Tenace, ensuring its mission aligns with future growth opportunities.\n\nIn addition to his entrepreneurial endeavors, Mohamed gained valuable experience through a summer internship at United Oil Services, where he contributed to various projects and grew his understanding of business operations. This experience further fueled his passion for entrepreneurship and provided insights into global business practices.\n\nCurrently a 10th-grade student at the International Programs School, Mohamed balances his academic pursuits with his entrepreneurial ambitions, demonstrating a strong commitment to both his education and his ventures. With a diverse skill set encompassing strategic planning, market research, investor relations, and UI/UX design, Mohamed is poised to continue making waves in the world of business and innovation.",
